  "conventions": [
    "All variables are real and every square root is the principal nonnegative root.",
    "sqrt(u^2) = |u| for real u.",
    "sqrt(u*v) = sqrt(u)*sqrt(v) for u >= 0 and v >= 0.",
    "sqrt(u/v) = sqrt(u)/sqrt(v) for u >= 0 and v > 0.",
    "r^2-s^2 = (r-s)*(r+s). Decimal constants are exact rationals.",
    "Natural domains are recorded separately; every requested strict or non-strict condition is retained."
